WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.600
A hybrid AI architecture uses more than one execution environment and places work

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:06.640
according to explicit requirements.

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:11.035
Local workstations or private servers may handle sensitive or latency-critical tasks.

00:00:11.035 --> 00:00:14.210
Cloud GPUs can provide temporary accelerator capacity.

00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:17.980
Hosted model APIs can offer capabilities that are difficult to operate locally,

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:21.700
while private cloud deployments extend organizational control into provider

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:22.680
infrastructure.

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:25.480
Hybrid does not mean sending every request to every environment.

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:29.250
It means defining which components process which inputs, where data is stored,

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:32.120
and how the system behaves when a preferred resource is unavailable.

00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:37.135
A local model and a cloud endpoint connected by an undocumented fallback are not a sound

00:00:37.135 --> 00:00:37.920
architecture.

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:40.830
The routing policy, privacy boundary, authentication, logging,

00:00:40.830 --> 00:00:43.400
and failure behavior must be visible and testable.

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:45.152
The design balances competing objectives.

00:00:45.152 --> 00:00:48.811
Local execution can improve privacy, control, and predictable marginal cost,

00:00:48.811 --> 00:00:52.040
but it is limited by owned hardware and maintenance capacity.

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:55.640
Cloud services offer elasticity, specialized models, and remote access,

00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:59.170
but introduce network latency, metered spending, provider dependency,

00:00:59.170 --> 00:01:00.595
and another data boundary.

00:01:00.595 --> 00:01:02.540
Reliability may improve through alternatives,

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:05.440
or decrease if additional dependencies are poorly managed.

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:07.960
Workload placement is an engineering decision,

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:11.120
not an ideological commitment to local or cloud.

00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:14.890
Begin with data classification, user experience, model capability, volume, availability,

00:01:14.890 --> 00:01:16.040
and cost.

00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:18.720
Choose the simplest placement that satisfies them, document why,

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:20.780
and measure the complete flow.

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:24.400
A useful hybrid system gains flexibility without making data movement or operational

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:25.800
responsibility ambiguous.
